{"content_hash": "af5524982c413f72", "version_id": 1055, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Xiaomi's Mijia Smart Aquarium 2 Pro grows to 30L and adds spot lighting", "title_zh": "小米米家智能鱼缸2 Pro升级至30L并新增聚光灯", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 281, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Xiaomi has launched the Mijia Smart Aquarium 2 Pro, the third tank in a series built around all-in-one design and app-based control. With a 55% jump in water volume, a redesigned top filter and a new spotlight, it aims to make fishkeeping easier for beginners.", "lead_zh": "小米推出了米家智能鱼缸2 Pro，这是该系列中第三款以一体式设计和App控制为核心的鱼缸。水量提升55%，顶部过滤器重新设计，并新增聚光灯，旨在让新手养鱼更轻松。", "preview": "The most tangible change is size. The original tank measured 446 × 246 × 295mm and held roughly 20L; the 2 Pro expands to 505 × 292 × 334mm ", "preview_zh": "最直观的变化是尺寸。初代鱼缸为446 × 246 × 295毫米，容量约20升；2 Pro扩大到505 × 292 × 334毫米，约30升。多出的10升为造景爱好者提供了更大空间来分层布置水草和硬景观，斑马鱼等群游鱼种也能游得更自在。代价是重量和维护：换水量更大，需要更大的容器", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1038, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 113.475, "size_bytes": 681840, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 116.375, "size_bytes": 699264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 123.95, "size_bytes": 744624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 107.875, "size_bytes": 648144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 115.65, "size_bytes": 694800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/1055.json", "paragraphs": ["The most tangible change is size. The original tank measured 446 × 246 × 295mm and held roughly 20L; the 2 Pro expands to 505 × 292 × 334mm and about 30L. That extra 10L gives aquascapers far more room to layer plants and hardscape, and shoaling species such as zebrafish swim more freely. The trade-off is weight and maintenance: larger water changes demand bigger containers, and furniture must bear the load.", "Filtration has shifted from a rear compartment to a top-mounted system with dry-wet separation, so solid waste such as fish faeces and leftover food is trapped in the filter box rather than left soaking in the water. A stronger pump drives noticeably greater flow and aeration, though keepers of weak-current species should watch for stress. A dedicated bay can house a heater, freeing space inside the tank.", "Lighting is the headline feature. Alongside an upgraded main array of 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, a single spotlight concentrates light on wood, stone and plants, creating dramatic contrast after dark. In practice, the new main light needs only about 20% brightness to match the old tank at 60%.", "The Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control remain central: users can monitor temperature, schedule lighting and feeding, and now receive recommended pump, light and feeding settings based on fish species, size and quantity — a useful starting point rather than a substitute for judgement.", "Some flaws persist. Condensation still clouds the glass, worsened in autumn and winter despite a ventilation slit, and the new top window fogs too. The first filter bay is cramped and enclosed, debris accumulates ahead of the pump, and the feeder has lost its physical portion control."], "paragraphs_zh": ["最直观的变化是尺寸。初代鱼缸为446 × 246 × 295毫米，容量约20升；2 Pro扩大到505 × 292 × 334毫米，约30升。多出的10升为造景爱好者提供了更大空间来分层布置水草和硬景观，斑马鱼等群游鱼种也能游得更自在。代价是重量和维护：换水量更大，需要更大的容器，家具也必须能承受重量。", "过滤系统从后部隔间改为顶部安装的干湿分离系统，鱼粪和残饵等固体废物会被截留在过滤盒中，而不是泡在水里。更强的水泵带来明显更大的水流和增氧，不过饲养弱流鱼种的人应注意应激。一个专用舱位可放置加热棒，从而腾出缸内空间。", "灯光是最大亮点。除升级后的主灯阵列（24颗白光和24颗RRGB LED）外，一盏聚光灯将光线集中在沉木、石头和水草上，入夜后营造出戏剧性的对比。实际使用中，新主灯只需约20%亮度即可达到旧款鱼缸60%的效果。", "米家App和小爱语音控制仍是核心：用户可以监测温度、定时开关灯和喂食，现在还新增了根据鱼的种类、大小和数量推荐水泵、灯光和喂食设置的功能——这是一个有用的起点，但不能替代用户的判断。", "一些缺陷依然存在。玻璃仍会起雾，秋冬季节尽管有通风缝也更严重，新的顶窗同样会起雾。第一个过滤舱狭窄且封闭，杂物会在水泵前堆积，喂食器也失去了物理分量控制。"], "body": "The most tangible change is size. The original tank measured 446 × 246 × 295mm and held roughly 20L; the 2 Pro expands to 505 × 292 × 334mm and about 30L. That extra 10L gives aquascapers far more room to layer plants and hardscape, and shoaling species such as zebrafish swim more freely. The trade-off is weight and maintenance: larger water changes demand bigger containers, and furniture must bear the load.\n\nFiltration has shifted from a rear compartment to a top-mounted system with dry-wet separation, so solid waste such as fish faeces and leftover food is trapped in the filter box rather than left soaking in the water. A stronger pump drives noticeably greater flow and aeration, though keepers of weak-current species should watch for stress. A dedicated bay can house a heater, freeing space inside the tank.\n\nLighting is the headline feature. Alongside an upgraded main array of 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, a single spotlight concentrates light on wood, stone and plants, creating dramatic contrast after dark. In practice, the new main light needs only about 20% brightness to match the old tank at 60%.\n\nThe Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control remain central: users can monitor temperature, schedule lighting and feeding, and now receive recommended pump, light and feeding settings based on fish species, size and quantity — a useful starting point rather than a substitute for judgement.\n\nSome flaws persist. Condensation still clouds the glass, worsened in autumn and winter despite a ventilation slit, and the new top window fogs too. The first filter bay is cramped and enclosed, debris accumulates ahead of the pump, and the feeder has lost its physical portion control.", "body_zh": "最直观的变化是尺寸。初代鱼缸为446 × 246 × 295毫米，容量约20升；2 Pro扩大到505 × 292 × 334毫米，约30升。多出的10升为造景爱好者提供了更大空间来分层布置水草和硬景观，斑马鱼等群游鱼种也能游得更自在。代价是重量和维护：换水量更大，需要更大的容器，家具也必须能承受重量。\n\n过滤系统从后部隔间改为顶部安装的干湿分离系统，鱼粪和残饵等固体废物会被截留在过滤盒中，而不是泡在水里。更强的水泵带来明显更大的水流和增氧，不过饲养弱流鱼种的人应注意应激。一个专用舱位可放置加热棒，从而腾出缸内空间。\n\n灯光是最大亮点。除升级后的主灯阵列（24颗白光和24颗RRGB LED）外，一盏聚光灯将光线集中在沉木、石头和水草上，入夜后营造出戏剧性的对比。实际使用中，新主灯只需约20%亮度即可达到旧款鱼缸60%的效果。\n\n米家App和小爱语音控制仍是核心：用户可以监测温度、定时开关灯和喂食，现在还新增了根据鱼的种类、大小和数量推荐水泵、灯光和喂食设置的功能——这是一个有用的起点，但不能替代用户的判断。\n\n一些缺陷依然存在。玻璃仍会起雾，秋冬季节尽管有通风缝也更严重，新的顶窗同样会起雾。第一个过滤舱狭窄且封闭，杂物会在水泵前堆积，喂食器也失去了物理分量控制。", "text": "The most tangible change is size. The original tank measured 446 × 246 × 295mm and held roughly 20L; the 2 Pro expands to 505 × 292 × 334mm and about 30L. That extra 10L gives aquascapers far more room to layer plants and hardscape, and shoaling species such as zebrafish swim more freely. The trade-off is weight and maintenance: larger water changes demand bigger containers, and furniture must bear the load. Filtration has shifted from a rear compartment to a top-mounted system with dry-wet separation, so solid waste such as fish faeces and leftover food is trapped in the filter box rather than left soaking in the water. A stronger pump drives noticeably greater flow and aeration, though keepers of weak-current species should watch for stress. A dedicated bay can house a heater, freeing space inside the tank. Lighting is the headline feature. Alongside an upgraded main array of 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, a single spotlight concentrates light on wood, stone and plants, creating dramatic contrast after dark. In practice, the new main light needs only about 20% brightness to match the old tank at 60%. The Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control remain central: users can monitor temperature, schedule lighting and feeding, and now receive recommended pump, light and feeding settings based on fish species, size and quantity — a useful starting point rather than a substitute for judgement. Some flaws persist. Condensation still clouds the glass, worsened in autumn and winter despite a ventilation slit, and the new top window fogs too. The first filter bay is cramped and enclosed, debris accumulates ahead of the pump, and the feeder has lost its physical portion control.", "vocab": [{"word": "aquascaping", "pos": "noun", "zh": "水族造景", "note": "指鱼缸内景观布置，爱好者常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shoaling", "pos": "adj", "zh": "群游的", "note": "形容鱼类成群游动，shoal 作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "faeces", "pos": "noun", "zh": "粪便", "note": "正式用语，美式拼写 feces", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "aeration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "增氧", "note": "水族设备常用术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "condensation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冷凝水雾", "note": "物理现象，也指玻璃起雾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trade-off", "pos": "noun", "zh": "权衡取舍", "note": "常与 between 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tangible", "pos": "adj", "zh": "切实可感的", "note": "反义 intangible", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drive", "pos": "verb", "zh": "驱动、推动", "note": "此处指水泵推动水流", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "concentrate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "集中", "note": "concentrate light on sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cramped", "pos": "adj", "zh": "狭窄的", "note": "形容空间局促", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "accumulate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "积聚", "note": "常用于污物、灰尘", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "substitute for", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "替代", "note": "a substitute for sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "headline feature", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主打卖点", "note": "新闻英语常见搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "persist", "pos": "verb", "zh": "持续存在", "note": "问题、现象仍存在", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T05:25:44.322164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "most", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.575, "sm": 325, "em": 574, "cs": 4, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "tangible", "s": 0.575, "e": 1.062, "sm": 575, "em": 1062, "cs": 9, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "change", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.425, "sm": 1062, "em": 1425, "cs": 18, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "is", "s": 1.425, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1425, "em": 1550, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "size", "s": 1.55, "e": 2.35, "sm": 1550, "em": 2350, "cs": 28, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": ".", "s": 2.35, "e": 2.45, "sm": 2350, "em": 2450, "cs": 32, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "The", "s": 2.45, "e":